flowchart LR
  IN[Idea + experiment log + template] --> O[1 Outline agent]
  O --> P[2 Plotting agent]
  O --> L[3 Literature review agent]
  P --> W[4 Section writing agent]
  L --> W
  W --> R[5 Content refinement]
  R -->|score rose: keep, iterate| R
  R -->|score fell or limit: revert, stop| OUT[LaTeX + PDF]
